# The decompile grind's intermediate artifacts — ~19.5 MB across 1,889
# files of disassembly dumps, per-function chunks and cross-vendor
# notes. The port that ships is the upstream Rust one; this was the road
# not taken. The decompiled SOURCE stays tracked (tools/decompile/output)
# because the README names it as the single-player fallback.
tools/decompile/analysis/
tools/decompile/chunks/
tools/decompile/cross-vendor/
